{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00485",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.19,
      "end_seconds": 5.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Good evening, doctor, thank you for staying late."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.84,
      "end_seconds": 11.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Right, no trouble at all, come in. What's been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.22,
      "end_seconds": 16.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "It's, It's trouble reading small print, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.56,
      "end_seconds": 27.77,
      "duration_seconds": 10.21,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.48,
      "end_seconds": 40.25,
      "duration_seconds": 11.77,
      "text": "Holding it further away helps a bit. Pretty mild, if I'm being honest. And there's blurry vision as well, two years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.75,
      "end_seconds": 47.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.37,
      "text": "Sure. Let me check a few things. Any redness, eye pain or flashes of light?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.45,
      "end_seconds": 50.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.03,
      "end_seconds": 52.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "How about floaters?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.29,
      "end_seconds": 55.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any floaters."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.81,
      "end_seconds": 62.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Okay, anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.64,
      "end_seconds": 69.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Okay, so no weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.64,
      "end_seconds": 74.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.89,
      "end_seconds": 77.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.86,
      "end_seconds": 83.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.14,
      "end_seconds": 87.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "None, as far as I'm aware."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.68,
      "end_seconds": 91.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "So, any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.71,
      "end_seconds": 94.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.26,
      "end_seconds": 99.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.04,
      "end_seconds": 102.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "My mother has diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.2,
      "end_seconds": 108.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.41,
      "end_seconds": 120.01,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "I skip breakfast most days. I stay with my daughter and her family. I play badminton on Sundays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.35,
      "end_seconds": 144.04,
      "duration_seconds": 6.69,
      "text": "So, any long-term health problems I should know about? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.77,
      "end_seconds": 161.26,
      "duration_seconds": 15.49,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for two years. I've had diabetes, yes. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.31,
      "end_seconds": 169.49,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "Alright, diabetes, that matches what I have here. What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.09,
      "end_seconds": 178.31,
      "duration_seconds": 8.22,
      "text": "I take losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day. Glycomet. I take it 500 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.85,
      "end_seconds": 179.66,
      "duration_seconds": 0.81,
      "text": "I see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.93,
      "end_seconds": 185.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "I used to take telmisartan, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.36,
      "end_seconds": 203.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Before we go on, a few quick readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.89,
      "end_seconds": 213.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.97,
      "end_seconds": 239.04,
      "duration_seconds": 8.07,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 113 over 77, heart rate 85, temp 36.7 degrees, SpO2 98 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.13,
      "end_seconds": 243.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Okay, a quick examination now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.39,
      "end_seconds": 247.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Almost done with this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.24,
      "end_seconds": 268.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Vision without glasses is six over twelve in both eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.0,
      "end_seconds": 272.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.5,
      "end_seconds": 287.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "The lens looks a little cloudy on both sides."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.52,
      "end_seconds": 302.15,
      "duration_seconds": 11.63,
      "text": "Thanks, please take a seat again. Having listened and examined, it fits best with a refractive problem or early cataracts. I'd also keep diabetic eye changes in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.87,
      "end_seconds": 307.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.8,
      "end_seconds": 316.54,
      "duration_seconds": 8.74,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a refractive problem or early cataracts is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.55,
      "end_seconds": 327.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "We should do an eye pressure check for blurred vision."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 328.99,
      "end_seconds": 332.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "I can book that for Friday at 2 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.56,
      "end_seconds": 337.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Friday, that works for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.23,
      "end_seconds": 356.65,
      "duration_seconds": 17.42,
      "text": "We should do a dilated eye examination for blurred vision. Get a proper glasses test, and keep your sugar and blood pressure well controlled for your eyes. I'd like to see you again in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.52,
      "end_seconds": 361.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Good, um, I'll come back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.08,
      "end_seconds": 368.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "How would you describe the plan, so we're on the same page?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.21,
      "end_seconds": 375.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "So, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.94,
      "end_seconds": 379.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Look after yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.23,
      "end_seconds": 384.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Nothing more from me, thanks."
    }
  ]
}